:parental_guilt rdf:type :BackgroundKnowledge ;
                rdfs:label "Parental Guilt"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The emotional state of guilt experienced by parents who feel they have failed in their parenting duties. The meme attempts to induce this feeling in parents who do not spank, suggesting that their choice is responsible for the negative outcome depicted (the car accident)."@en ;
