:misleading_visual_metaphor rdf:type :BackgroundKnowledge ;
                rdfs:label "Misleading Visual Metaphor"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The use of an image to represent an abstract concept in a way that is misleading or inaccurate. The overturned car is used as a metaphor for the consequences of not spanking, which is a dramatic and inaccurate representation of the complex issue of child-rearing."@en ;
